# Subagent source

This is the portable source area for persona and subagent definitions. Imported formats that are not yet supported belong under `imported/` only after an explicit human review; the quickstart never guesses how to convert them.

Runtime transcripts, telemetry, credentials, and private memory belong in `../../state/`, not here.

Supported Hermes agent files are imported under `imported/hermes/` after privacy and filesystem checks. Kimi may discover these files through the bridge catalog, but the bridge does not auto-register or rewrite personas.
